        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: возвращаться",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "возвращаться (vozvrashchátsya) — \"to come back, to return\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "возвращаться (vozvrashchátsya) is воз-, \"back\", with вращать, \"to turn\", and -ся: to turn yourself back. вращать is the Church Slavonic shape of native ворочать, on the root of вертеть, \"to turn\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
